  "limits": [
    "No formal App, real Agent, database, browser, Cargo, full build or installed ZIP extraction was run by this author. Root owns complete controlled browser and later installed validation.",
    "Only already-loaded readable transcript content and explicitly opted-in loaded text/diff/terminal details are included; unloaded history, raw tool envelopes, thoughts, drafts and queued content are outside this export.",
    "User/assistant body text and selected file bytes are preserved, and may contain private information. Generated source metadata omits automatic local path/URI fields; filenames are display metadata rather than universal secret filtering.",
